rtl8723fu-firmware
==================

Realtek Bluetooth firmware blobs (rtl8723fu_fw.bin, rtl8723fu_config.bin)
used by the RTL8733BU combo chip. These files are vendor firmware, not
open source, and not original Zlyme code.

SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-proprietary
RTL8723FU_FIRMWARE_REDISTRIBUTE = NO in the recipe.

Zlyme does not grant any additional license to this material.
Redistribute only as Realtek permits.
